                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/301: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in France</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-12-21T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>430. Your 427, December 20, 8 p.m. The good offices of the Conference having been
                    accepted no further observations would appear to be required.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
